  "description": "This stereotype portrays Black individuals as inherently criminal. In this meme, the man’s serious, unamused expression is juxtaposed with the absurd accusation of farting, which can be interpreted as a form of racial mockery that implies his behavior is inherently crude or criminal. The meme relies on the viewer’s implicit understanding of this stereotype to generate its humor, which is rooted in racial prejudice.",
